#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1017 expect=skipped domain=SV
#note "CG0213 trio alignment (wave TA-5, plan §14 ruling 2): the owner ruled the one-line Requirements.Variables.All [VISITNUM] gate - already carried by PMDA-SD1017 - is applied to the FDA and CDISC legs, re-promoting the class to aligned. SV here has no VISITNUM column at all: without the gate the engine read the absent column as empty and the not empty(VISITNUM) guard silenced it row by row; with the gate the engine records one auditable skip instead of walking rows for a column that is not there."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SV label="Subject Visits"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
col SVSTDTC  type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Visit"
col SVUPDES  type=Char label="Description of Unplanned Visit"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SV | 001 | SCREENING | 2020-01-01 |
---

dataset TV label="Trial Visits"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col VISITNUM type=Num  label="Visit Number"
col VISIT    type=Char label="Visit Name"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TV | 1 | SCREENING
---
